<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: FBD Insurance 1996 pre-tax profit up 5.1 pc.</title>
<headline>FBD Insurance 1996 pre-tax profit up 5.1 pc.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		28.1		   vs 26.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.35		   vs 3.773</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 7.7		    vs 6.7375</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    14.67		  vs 13.96</p>
<p> Turnover		   145.39		 vs 136.59</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name - FBD Insurance Plc is an Irish-based insurance company.</p>
